<title>LITHUANIA: CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR JUNE 12/13.</title>
<headline>CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR JUNE 12/13.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania set the</p>
<p>following currency fixings for Friday, June 13 on Thursday.</p>
<p>The litas is pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to</p>
<p>one.</p>
<p>		   13.06.97	  12.06.97</p>
<p>    USD	  4.0000	    4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	  6.5276	    6.5668</p>
<p>    DEM	  2.3194	    2.3394</p>
<p>    ECU	  4.5182	    4.5490</p>
<p>    100JPY     3.4965	    3.6057</p>
<p>    SEK	  0.5143	    0.5155</p>
<p>    FIM	  0.7728	    0.7779</p>
<p>    EEK	  0.2899	    0.2925</p>
<p>    LAT	  7.0016	    7.0628</p>
<p>    1000RUR    0.6940	    0.6946	    </p>
<p>    PLN	  1.2367	    1.2434</p>
<p>--Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
